# Licensed content that must never reach this public repo: Asset Store packages
# (BoZo, free ones too), Mixamo FBX, anything whose licence forbids redistribution.
# Lives only on the Director's machine; prefabs may reference it by GUID.
/[Aa]ssets/_Licensed/
/[Aa]ssets/_Licensed.meta

